Package: dmabuf-import-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms
Conflicts: udmabuf-import-dkms
Replaces: udmabuf-import-dkms
Description: experimental out-of-tree dma-buf importer (DKMS)
 Standalone out-of-tree kernel module providing dma-buf import ioctls
 (DMABUF_IMPORT_ATTACH / DMABUF_IMPORT_DETACH / DMABUF_IMPORT_GET_MAP) on a
 dedicated /dev/dmabuf_import misc device. It imports an external dma-buf (a
 CPU buffer via udmabuf+memfd, or GPU memory via the NVIDIA driver) and shares
 its DMA addresses with userspace. Any dma-buf can be imported, whoever
 exported it.
 .
 The ioctls originated as a patch to the in-tree, built-in udmabuf driver
 (CONFIG_UDMABUF=y), which forced a full kernel rebuild, and their magic and
 numbers still match it. They are additive and self-contained, using only
 exported dma-buf core APIs, so they are shipped here as their own module.
 Built and installed via DKMS, it rebuilds automatically on kernel updates
 with no custom kernel required.
